#. governanceProposals.airspace-practicals.sponsor
#: src/data/governance.js:8
msgctxt "text:governanceProposals.airspace-practicals.sponsor"
msgid "Joint Flight Safety Council (Aya says she only records it)"
msgstr "飛行安全合同会（文は記録のみと主張）"

#. governanceProposals.airspace-practicals.title
#: src/data/governance.js:9
msgctxt "text:governanceProposals.airspace-practicals.title"
msgid "Who may close Boundary Hall airspace during make-up danmaku?"
msgstr "追試弾幕中、誰が境界講堂空域を閉鎖できるか"

#. governanceProposals.airspace-practicals.summary
#: src/data/governance.js:10
msgctxt "text:governanceProposals.airspace-practicals.summary"
msgid ""
"Rules require agreement from Academic Affairs, the hall, and Windway "
"Control. Last week all three messengers waited for each other in the same "
"gust."
msgstr "現行規程は教務・講堂・風路の三者同意を要求。しかし先週、三者の使者は同じ風で互いを待った。"

#. governanceProposals.airspace-practicals.choices.registrar.label
#: src/data/governance.js:12
msgctxt "text:governanceProposals.airspace-practicals.choices.registrar.label"
msgid "Registrar may close one period, signatures follow"
msgstr "教務が一時限を先行閉鎖、後日三者署名"

#. governanceProposals.airspace-practicals.choices.registrar.consequence
#: src/data/governance.js:12
msgctxt "text:governanceProposals.airspace-practicals.choices.registrar.consequence"
msgid "Fast; Keine records who ratified last."
msgstr "迅速。慧音が最後の追認者を記録する。"

#. governanceProposals.airspace-practicals.choices.reimu.label
#: src/data/governance.js:13
msgctxt "text:governanceProposals.airspace-practicals.choices.reimu.label"
msgid "Reimu decides on site; attendance optional"
msgstr "霊夢が現場判断。ただし来ない選択可"

#. governanceProposals.airspace-practicals.choices.reimu.consequence
#: src/data/governance.js:13
msgctxt "text:governanceProposals.airspace-practicals.choices.reimu.consequence"
msgid "Direct boundary judgment, minimal administrative predictability."
msgstr "境界判断は直截、行政予測性は最低。"

#. governanceProposals.airspace-practicals.choices.aya.label
#: src/data/governance.js:14
msgctxt "text:governanceProposals.airspace-practicals.choices.aya.label"
msgid "Aya publishes “closed”; correct later if needed"
msgstr "文が「閉鎖済」を発行、未閉鎖なら訂正"

#. governanceProposals.airspace-practicals.choices.aya.consequence
#: src/data/governance.js:14
msgctxt "text:governanceProposals.airspace-practicals.choices.aya.consequence"
msgid "Fastest information; causality goes to a journalism defence."
msgstr "情報最速。因果順序は新聞学部の答弁へ。"

#. governanceProposals.airspace-practicals.reaction
#: src/data/governance.js:16
msgctxt "text:governanceProposals.airspace-practicals.reaction"
msgid "After the airspace vote, all three offices say they were merely consulted"
msgstr "空域案投票後、三機関すべてが「諮問されただけ」と発表"

#. governanceProposals.fullmoon-library.sponsor
#: src/data/governance.js:22
msgctxt "text:governanceProposals.fullmoon-library.sponsor"
msgid "Misty Lake Library and Provisional Full-Moon Readers"
msgstr "霧の湖図書館・満月読者臨時席"

#. governanceProposals.fullmoon-library.title
#: src/data/governance.js:23
msgctxt "text:governanceProposals.fullmoon-library.title"
msgid "Extend full-moon reading, or let the holdings rest first?"
msgstr "満月夜間閲覧を延長するか、蔵書を先に休ませるか"

#. governanceProposals.fullmoon-library.summary
#: src/data/governance.js:24
msgctxt "text:governanceProposals.fullmoon-library.summary"
msgid ""
"Some books reveal text only at full moon; others refuse readers then. Both "
"claim accessibility status."
msgstr "満月だけ文字を出す本と、満月は読まれるのを拒む本がある。双方が自分をアクセシビリティ対象と主張。"

#. governanceProposals.fullmoon-library.choices.split.label
#: src/data/governance.js:26
msgctxt "text:governanceProposals.fullmoon-library.choices.split.label"
msgid "North Wing extends; South goes dark; books may move"
msgstr "北翼延長・南翼消灯、本は自分で移動可"

#. governanceProposals.fullmoon-library.choices.split.consequence
#: src/data/governance.js:26
msgctxt "text:governanceProposals.fullmoon-library.choices.split.consequence"
msgid "Balances both; flying holdings gain an institutional advantage."
msgstr "双方に配慮。飛行資料が制度上有利。"

#. governanceProposals.fullmoon-library.choices.appointment.label
#: src/data/governance.js:27
msgctxt "text:governanceProposals.fullmoon-library.choices.appointment.label"
msgid "Moon-visible books by appointment"
msgstr "満月可視本は予約閲覧へ"

#. governanceProposals.fullmoon-library.choices.appointment.consequence
#: src/data/governance.js:27
msgctxt "text:governanceProposals.fullmoon-library.choices.appointment.consequence"
msgid "Manageable, except the booking form appears only at new moon."
msgstr "管理可能。ただし予約票は新月のみ可視。"

#. governanceProposals.fullmoon-library.choices.books-vote.label
#: src/data/governance.js:28
msgctxt "text:governanceProposals.fullmoon-library.choices.books-vote.label"
msgid "Let holdings vote; call numbers count as student IDs"
msgstr "蔵書投票・請求番号を学籍番号扱い"

#. governanceProposals.fullmoon-library.choices.books-vote.consequence
#: src/data/governance.js:28
msgctxt "text:governanceProposals.fullmoon-library.choices.books-vote.consequence"
msgid "Most coexistential; shelves demand constituency status."
msgstr "共生的。書架は選挙区認定を要求。"

#. governanceProposals.fullmoon-library.reaction
#: src/data/governance.js:30
msgctxt "text:governanceProposals.fullmoon-library.reaction"
msgid ""
"Full-moon library count opens; three abstaining books ask whether abstention "
"is checked out"
msgstr "図書館満月案開票、棄権三冊が「棄権は貸出中か」を質問"

#. governanceProposals.red-thread-appeal.sponsor
#: src/data/governance.js:36
msgctxt "text:governanceProposals.red-thread-appeal.sponsor"
msgid "Red-Thread Review Desk and Campus Corrections"
msgstr "赤糸記録査読席・学報訂正欄"

#. governanceProposals.red-thread-appeal.title
#: src/data/governance.js:37
msgctxt "text:governanceProposals.red-thread-appeal.title"
msgid "How large must the warning be when citing a contested closure?"
msgstr "係争終結を引用する際、警告はどの大きさなら可視か"

#. governanceProposals.red-thread-appeal.summary
#: src/data/governance.js:38
msgctxt "text:governanceProposals.red-thread-appeal.summary"
msgid ""
"Keine wants warnings as large as headlines. Aya says that makes the warning "
"a second headline requiring its own correction."
msgstr "慧音は警告を見出し同寸に要求。文は警告が第二見出しとなり、独自訂正が必要だと主張。"

#. governanceProposals.red-thread-appeal.choices.same-size.label
#: src/data/governance.js:40
msgctxt "text:governanceProposals.red-thread-appeal.choices.same-size.label"
msgid "Same size and same view as the claim"
msgstr "主張と同寸・同画面"

#. governanceProposals.red-thread-appeal.choices.same-size.consequence
#: src/data/governance.js:40
msgctxt "text:governanceProposals.red-thread-appeal.choices.same-size.consequence"
msgid "Hardest to miss; newspaper space falls forty percent."
msgstr "最も見落としにくい。紙面は四割減。"

#. governanceProposals.red-thread-appeal.choices.red-border.label
#: src/data/governance.js:41
msgctxt "text:governanceProposals.red-thread-appeal.choices.red-border.label"
msgid "Red border + reviewer + original verdict"
msgstr "赤枠＋査読者＋元 verdict"

#. governanceProposals.red-thread-appeal.choices.red-border.consequence
#: src/data/governance.js:41
msgctxt "text:governanceProposals.red-thread-appeal.choices.red-border.consequence"
msgid "Keeps context; Yukari asks where the border itself belongs."
msgstr "文脈保持。紫は枠内外の定義を要求。"

#. governanceProposals.red-thread-appeal.choices.headline.label
#: src/data/governance.js:42
msgctxt "text:governanceProposals.red-thread-appeal.choices.headline.label"
msgid "Aya decides; one error pauses publication 15 minutes"
msgstr "文が決定、誤り一回で十五分休刊"

#. governanceProposals.red-thread-appeal.choices.headline.consequence
#: src/data/governance.js:42
msgctxt "text:governanceProposals.red-thread-appeal.choices.headline.consequence"
msgid "Fastest; an extra edition usually appears during the pause."
msgstr "最速。休刊中には通常号外が出る。"

#. governanceProposals.red-thread-appeal.reaction
#: src/data/governance.js:44
msgctxt "text:governanceProposals.red-thread-appeal.reaction"
msgid ""
"Red-thread warning bill reaches second reading; Aya preprints “University "
"limits font freedom”"
msgstr "赤糸警告字級案が二読へ、文は先に「大学、書体自由を制限」"

#. governanceProposals.canteen-names.sponsor
#: src/data/governance.js:50
msgctxt "text:governanceProposals.canteen-names.sponsor"
msgid "Dining Naming Committee (formed after lunch)"
msgstr "食堂命名委員会（昼食後設置）"

#. governanceProposals.canteen-names.title
#: src/data/governance.js:51
msgctxt "text:governanceProposals.canteen-names.title"
msgid "Must a menu name allow inference of its main ingredient?"
msgstr "献立名から主材料を推論できるべきか"

#. governanceProposals.canteen-names.summary
#: src/data/governance.js:52
msgctxt "text:governanceProposals.canteen-names.summary"
msgid ""
"Yesterday Boundary Bowl contained tofu; today it contains the boundary "
"between bowl and outside. Nutrition refuses to calculate protein for the "
"latter."
msgstr "「境界丼」は昨日豆腐、今日は椀内外の境界。栄養室は後者の蛋白質計算を拒否。"

#. governanceProposals.canteen-names.choices.ingredient.label
#: src/data/governance.js:54
msgctxt "text:governanceProposals.canteen-names.choices.ingredient.label"
msgid "Name at least one edible ingredient"
msgstr "名称に可食材料を一つ以上"

#. governanceProposals.canteen-names.choices.ingredient.consequence
#: src/data/governance.js:54
msgctxt "text:governanceProposals.canteen-names.choices.ingredient.consequence"
msgid "Safest for outsiders; Youmu files “half” as an ingredient."
msgstr "外界生に安心。妖夢は「半分」を材料申請。"

#. governanceProposals.canteen-names.choices.footnote.label
#: src/data/governance.js:55
msgctxt "text:governanceProposals.canteen-names.choices.footnote.label"
msgid "Keep poetic names with a traceable footnote"
msgstr "詩的名称を維持、追跡可能な注記"

#. governanceProposals.canteen-names.choices.footnote.consequence
#: src/data/governance.js:55
msgctxt "text:governanceProposals.canteen-names.choices.footnote.consequence"
msgid "Dining agrees; today’s footnote is longer than the name."
msgstr "食堂同意。注記は本日、名称より長い。"

#. governanceProposals.canteen-names.choices.mystery.label
#: src/data/governance.js:56
msgctxt "text:governanceProposals.canteen-names.choices.mystery.label"
msgid "Keep one non-inferable dish each day"
msgstr "一日一品は推論不能料理"

#. governanceProposals.canteen-names.choices.mystery.consequence
#: src/data/governance.js:56
msgctxt "text:governanceProposals.canteen-names.choices.mystery.consequence"
msgid "Highest research value; Allergies Office votes no."
msgstr "研究価値最大。アレルギー室は反対。"

#. governanceProposals.canteen-names.reaction
#: src/data/governance.js:58
msgctxt "text:governanceProposals.canteen-names.reaction"
msgid "Dining-name vote opens; Today’s Special requests stakeholder speaking time"
msgstr "献立命名案の投票開始、「本日の特餐」が利害関係者発言を要求"
